{
  "type": "USJ",
  "version": "3.0",
  "content": [
    {
      "type": "book",
      "marker": "id",
      "code": "1TI",
      "content": [
        "Autogenerated BSB by bsb2usfm"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "h",
      "content": [
        "1 Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "toc1",
      "content": [
        "1 Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "toc2",
      "content": [
        "1 Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "toc3",
      "content": [
        "1TI"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "mt1",
      "content": [
        "1 Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "1",
      "sid": "1TI 1"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Paul’s Greeting to Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "2TI 1:1-2",
          "content": [
            "2 Timothy 1:1–2"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1TI 1:1"
        },
        "Paul, an apostle of Christ Jesus by ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " command of God our Savior and of Christ Jesus our hope,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1TI 1:2"
        },
        "To Timothy, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " true child in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " faith:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "Grace, mercy, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " peace from God ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Father and Christ Jesus our Lord."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Correcting False Teachers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "TIT 1:10-16",
          "content": [
            "Titus 1:10–16"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1TI 1:3"
        },
        "As I urged you on my departure to Macedonia, you should stay on at Ephesus to instruct certain men not to teach false doctrines ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1TI 1:4"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " devote themselves to myths and endless genealogies, which promote speculation rather than ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " stewardship of God’s ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "work"
          ]
        },
        ", which ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " by faith.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:4 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "rather than the stewardship of God in faith"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1TI 1:5"
        },
        "The goal of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "our"
          ]
        },
        " instruction is ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " love ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that comes"
          ]
        },
        " from a pure heart, a clear conscience, and a sincere faith. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1TI 1:6"
        },
        "Some have strayed from  ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "these ways "
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " turned aside to empty talk. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1TI 1:7"
        },
        "They want to be teachers of the law, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " they do not understand what they are saying ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that"
          ]
        },
        " which they so confidently assert."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1TI 1:8"
        },
        "Now we know that the law ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " good, if one uses it legitimately. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1TI 1:9"
        },
        "We realize that law is not enacted for ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " righteous, but for ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " lawless and rebellious, for ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " ungodly and sinful, for ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " unholy and profane, for killers of father ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " mother, for murderers, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1TI 1:10"
        },
        "for the sexually immoral, for homosexuals, for slave traders",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "1:10 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "for kidnappers"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " liars ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " perjurers, and for anyone else who is averse to sound teaching ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1TI 1:11"
        },
        "that agrees with the glorious gospel of the blessed God, with which I have been entrusted."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "God’s Grace to Paul"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1TI 1:12"
        },
        "I thank Christ Jesus our Lord, who has strengthened me, that He considered me faithful ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " appointed ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "me"
          ]
        },
        " to service. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1TI 1:13"
        },
        "I was formerly a blasphemer, a persecutor, and a violent ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "man"
          ]
        },
        "; yet because I had acted in ignorance ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " unbelief, I was shown mercy. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1TI 1:14"
        },
        "And the grace of our Lord overflowed ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to me"
          ]
        },
        ", along with ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " faith and love that ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "are"
          ]
        },
        " in Christ Jesus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1TI 1:15"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "This is a"
          ]
        },
        " trustworthy saying, worthy of full acceptance: Christ Jesus came into the world to save sinners, of whom I am ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " worst. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "1TI 1:16"
        },
        "But for this very reason I was shown mercy, so that in me, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " worst ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "of sinners "
          ]
        },
        ", Christ Jesus might display ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "His"
          ]
        },
        " perfect patience as an example to those who would believe in Him for eternal life. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "1TI 1:17"
        },
        "Now to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " King eternal, immortal, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " invisible, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " only God, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "be"
          ]
        },
        " honor and glory forever ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " ever. Amen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "1TI 1:18"
        },
        "Timothy, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "my"
          ]
        },
        " child, I entrust you with this command in keeping with the previous prophecies about you, so that by them you may fight the good fight, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "1TI 1:19"
        },
        "holding on to faith and a good conscience, which some have rejected ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and thereby"
          ]
        },
        " shipwrecked ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " faith. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "1TI 1:20"
        },
        "Among ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "them"
          ]
        },
        " are Hymenaeus and Alexander, whom I have handed over to Satan to be taught not to blaspheme."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "2",
      "sid": "1TI 2"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A Call to Prayer"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1TI 2:1"
        },
        "First of all, then, I urge that petitions, prayers, intercessions, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " thanksgiving be offered for everyone— ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1TI 2:2"
        },
        "for kings and all those in authority— so that we may lead tranquil and quiet lives in all godliness and dignity. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1TI 2:3"
        },
        "This ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " good and pleasing in the sight of God our Savior, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1TI 2:4"
        },
        "who wants everyone to be saved and to come to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " knowledge of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " truth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1TI 2:5"
        },
        "For ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "there is"
          ]
        },
        " one God, and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "there is"
          ]
        },
        " one mediator between God and men, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " man Christ Jesus, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1TI 2:6"
        },
        "who gave Himself ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as"
          ]
        },
        " a ransom for all — the testimony that was given at just the right time."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1TI 2:7"
        },
        "For ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "this reason"
          ]
        },
        " I was appointed as a preacher, an apostle, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " a faithful and true teacher of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Gentiles. I am telling ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " truth; ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "I am"
          ]
        },
        " not lying ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "about anything "
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1TI 2:8"
        },
        "Therefore I want the men everywhere",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:8 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "in every place (of worship)"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " to pray, lifting up holy hands, without anger ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " dissension."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Instructions to Women"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1TI 2:9"
        },
        "Likewise, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "I want"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " women to adorn themselves with respectable apparel, with modesty, and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "with"
          ]
        },
        " self-control, not with braided hair or gold or pearls or expensive clothes, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1TI 2:10"
        },
        "but with good deeds, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as"
          ]
        },
        " is proper for women ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who"
          ]
        },
        " profess to worship God."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1TI 2:11"
        },
        "A woman",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:11 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "wife"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "; also in verse 12"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " must learn in quietness ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " full submissiveness. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1TI 2:12"
        },
        "I do not permit a woman to teach ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " to exercise authority over a man;",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:12 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "over her husband"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " she is to remain quiet. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1TI 2:13"
        },
        "For Adam was formed first, and then Eve. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1TI 2:14"
        },
        "And ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "it was"
          ]
        },
        " not Adam ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who"
          ]
        },
        " was deceived, but the woman ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who"
          ]
        },
        " was deceived ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " fell into transgression. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1TI 2:15"
        },
        "Women, however, will be saved",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "2:15 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "She, however, will be saved"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " through childbearing, if they continue in faith, love, and holiness, with self-control."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "3",
      "sid": "1TI 3"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Qualifications for Overseers"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "TIT 1:5-9",
          "content": [
            "Titus 1:5–9"
          ]
        },
        "; ",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "1PE 5:1-4",
          "content": [
            "1 Peter 5:1–4"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1TI 3:1"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "This is"
          ]
        },
        " a trustworthy saying: If anyone aspires to be an overseer, he desires a noble task. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1TI 3:2"
        },
        "An overseer, then, must be above reproach, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " husband of but one wife,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:2 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "faithful to his wife"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "; also in verse 12"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " temperate, self-controlled, respectable, hospitable, able to teach, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1TI 3:3"
        },
        "not dependent on wine, not violent but gentle, peaceable, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " free of the love of money."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1TI 3:4"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "An overseer must"
          ]
        },
        " manage ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "his"
          ]
        },
        " own household well ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " keep ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "his"
          ]
        },
        " children under control, with complete dignity. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1TI 3:5"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "For"
          ]
        },
        " if someone ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "does"
          ]
        },
        " not know how to manage ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "his"
          ]
        },
        " own household, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "how"
          ]
        },
        " can he care for ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " church of God? ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1TI 3:6"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "He must"
          ]
        },
        " not ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "be"
          ]
        },
        " a recent convert, or he may become conceited ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " fall under ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the same "
          ]
        },
        " condemnation as the devil. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1TI 3:7"
        },
        "Furthermore, he must have a good reputation with outsiders, so that he will not fall into disgrace and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "into the"
          ]
        },
        " snare of the devil."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Qualifications for Deacons"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "ACT 6:1-7",
          "content": [
            "Acts 6:1–7"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1TI 3:8"
        },
        "Deacons likewise ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "must be"
          ]
        },
        " dignified, not double-tongued ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " given to much wine ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " greedy for money. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1TI 3:9"
        },
        "They must hold to the mystery of the faith with a clear conscience. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1TI 3:10"
        },
        "Additionally, they must first be tested. Then, if they are above reproach, let them serve as deacons."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1TI 3:11"
        },
        "In the same way, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " women",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:11 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "their wives"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "must be"
          ]
        },
        " dignified, not slanderers, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "but"
          ]
        },
        " temperate ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " faithful in all things."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1TI 3:12"
        },
        "A deacon must be ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " husband of but one wife, a good manager ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "of his"
          ]
        },
        " children and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "of his"
          ]
        },
        " own household. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1TI 3:13"
        },
        "For those who have served well ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as deacons"
          ]
        },
        " acquire for themselves a high standing and great confidence in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " faith that ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " in Christ Jesus."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "The Mystery of Godliness"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1TI 3:14"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Although"
          ]
        },
        " I hope to come to you soon, I am writing you these things ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1TI 3:15"
        },
        "in case I am delayed, so that you will know how each one must conduct himself in God’s household, which is ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " church of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " living God, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " pillar and foundation of the truth."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "1TI 3:16"
        },
        "By common confession, the mystery of godliness is great:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "b"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q1",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "He"
          ]
        },
        " appeared",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:16 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Literally "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "He who appeared"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "; BYZ and TR "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "God appeared"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " flesh,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "was vindicated by ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Spirit,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "3:16 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "Or "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "vindicated in spirit"
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q1",
      "content": [
        "was seen by angels,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "was proclaimed among ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " nations,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q1",
      "content": [
        "was believed in throughout ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " world,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "q2",
      "content": [
        "was taken up in glory."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "4",
      "sid": "1TI 4"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A Warning against Apostasy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1TI 4:1"
        },
        "Now the Spirit expressly states that in later times some will abandon the faith to follow deceitful spirits and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " teachings of demons, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1TI 4:2"
        },
        "influenced by ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " hypocrisy of liars, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "whose"
          ]
        },
        " consciences are seared with a hot iron."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1TI 4:3"
        },
        "They will prohibit marriage ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and require"
          ]
        },
        " abstinence from certain foods that God has created to be received with thanksgiving by those who believe and know the truth. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1TI 4:4"
        },
        "For every creation of God ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " good, and nothing that is received with thanksgiving should be rejected, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1TI 4:5"
        },
        "because it is sanctified by ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " word of God and prayer."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A Good Servant of Jesus Christ"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1TI 4:6"
        },
        "By pointing out these things to the brothers, you will be a good servant of Christ Jesus, nourished by the words of faith and sound instruction that you have followed."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1TI 4:7"
        },
        "But reject irreverent, silly myths. Instead, train yourself for godliness. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1TI 4:8"
        },
        "For physical exercise is of limited value, but godliness is valuable in every ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "way"
          ]
        },
        ", holding promise for the present life and for the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "one"
          ]
        },
        " to come. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1TI 4:9"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "This is"
          ]
        },
        " a trustworthy saying, worthy of full acceptance."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1TI 4:10"
        },
        "To this ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "end"
          ]
        },
        " we labor and strive,",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "4:10 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "SBL, BYZ, and TR "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "and suffer reproach"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " because we have set our hope on ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " living God, who is ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " Savior of everyone, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " especially of those who believe. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1TI 4:11"
        },
        "Command and teach these things."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1TI 4:12"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Let"
          ]
        },
        " no one despise your youth, but set an example for the believers in speech, in conduct, in love, in faith, in purity. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1TI 4:13"
        },
        "Until I come, devote yourself to the public reading of Scripture, to exhortation, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " to teaching."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1TI 4:14"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Do"
          ]
        },
        " not neglect the gift ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "that is"
          ]
        },
        " in you, which was given you through ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " prophecy spoken ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "over you"
          ]
        },
        " at ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " laying on of the hands of the elders. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1TI 4:15"
        },
        "Be diligent in these matters ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " absorbed in them, so that your progress will be evident to all. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "1TI 4:16"
        },
        "Pay close attention to your ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "life"
          ]
        },
        " and to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "your"
          ]
        },
        " teaching. Persevere in these things, for by so doing you will save both yourself and those who hear you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "5",
      "sid": "1TI 5"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Reproof and Respect"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1TI 5:1"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Do"
          ]
        },
        " not rebuke an older man, but appeal to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "him"
          ]
        },
        " as to a father."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Treat"
          ]
        },
        " younger ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "men"
          ]
        },
        " as brothers, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1TI 5:2"
        },
        "older ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "women"
          ]
        },
        " as mothers, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " younger ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "women"
          ]
        },
        " as sisters, with absolute purity."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Honoring True Widows"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "RUT 1:1-5",
          "content": [
            "Ruth 1:1–5"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1TI 5:3"
        },
        "Honor ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " widows who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "are"
          ]
        },
        " truly widows. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1TI 5:4"
        },
        "But if a widow has children or grandchildren, they must first learn to show godliness to ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " own family and repay ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " parents, for this is pleasing in the sight of God."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1TI 5:5"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "The widow"
          ]
        },
        " who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " truly ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "in need"
          ]
        },
        " and left all alone puts ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "her"
          ]
        },
        " hope in God and continues night and day in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "her"
          ]
        },
        " petitions and prayers. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1TI 5:6"
        },
        "But she who lives for pleasure is dead ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "even while she"
          ]
        },
        " is still alive."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1TI 5:7"
        },
        "Give these instructions ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to the believers"
          ]
        },
        ", so that they will be above reproach. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1TI 5:8"
        },
        "If anyone does not provide for ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "his"
          ]
        },
        " own, and especially ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "his own"
          ]
        },
        " household, he has denied the faith and is worse than an unbeliever."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1TI 5:9"
        },
        "A widow should be enrolled if she is ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "at least"
          ]
        },
        " sixty years ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "old"
          ]
        },
        ", faithful to her husband, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1TI 5:10"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " well known for good deeds ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "such as"
          ]
        },
        " bringing up children, entertaining strangers, washing ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " feet of the saints, imparting relief to the afflicted, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " devoting herself to every good work."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1TI 5:11"
        },
        "But refuse ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to enroll"
          ]
        },
        " younger widows. For when their passions draw them away from Christ, they will want to marry, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1TI 5:12"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and thus"
          ]
        },
        " will incur judgment because they are setting aside ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " first faith. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1TI 5:13"
        },
        "At the same time they will also learn ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to be"
          ]
        },
        " idle, going from house to house and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "being"
          ]
        },
        " not only idle, but also gossips and busybodies, discussing things they should not ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "mention "
          ]
        },
        "."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1TI 5:14"
        },
        "So I advise ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " younger ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "widows"
          ]
        },
        " to marry, have children, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " manage their households, denying the adversary occasion for slander. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1TI 5:15"
        },
        "For some have already turned aside to follow Satan."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "1TI 5:16"
        },
        "If any believing ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "woman"
          ]
        },
        " has ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "dependent"
          ]
        },
        " widows, she must assist them and not ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "allow"
          ]
        },
        " the church to be burdened, so that it can help the widows ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who are"
          ]
        },
        " truly ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "in need "
          ]
        },
        "."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Honoring Elders"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "1TI 5:17"
        },
        "Elders who lead effectively are worthy of double honor, especially those who work hard at preaching and teaching. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "1TI 5:18"
        },
        "For the Scripture says, “Do not muzzle an ox while it is treading out the grain,”",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "5:18 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "ref",
                  "loc": "DEU 25:4",
                  "content": [
                    "Deuteronomy 25:4"
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " and, “The worker ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "is"
          ]
        },
        " worthy of his wages.”",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "5:18 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "ref",
                  "loc": "LUK 10:7",
                  "content": [
                    "Luke 10:7"
                  ]
                },
                "; see also Leviticus 19:13 and Deuteronomy 24:14–15."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "1TI 5:19"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Do"
          ]
        },
        " not entertain an accusation against an elder, except on ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the testimony of"
          ]
        },
        " two or three witnesses. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "1TI 5:20"
        },
        "But those who persist in sin should be rebuked in front of everyone, so that the others will stand in fear ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "of sin"
          ]
        },
        "."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A Charge to Timothy"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "1TI 5:21"
        },
        "I solemnly charge ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "you"
          ]
        },
        " before God and Christ Jesus and the elect angels to maintain these ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "principles"
          ]
        },
        " without bias, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " to do nothing out of partiality."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "22",
          "sid": "1TI 5:22"
        },
        "Do not be too quick in the laying on of hands ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and thereby"
          ]
        },
        " share in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " sins of others. Keep yourself pure."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "23",
          "sid": "1TI 5:23"
        },
        "Stop drinking ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "only"
          ]
        },
        " water ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " use a little wine instead, because of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "your"
          ]
        },
        " stomach and your frequent ailments."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "24",
          "sid": "1TI 5:24"
        },
        "The sins of some men are obvious, going ahead of ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "them"
          ]
        },
        " to judgment; but ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the sins"
          ]
        },
        " of others do ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "not"
          ]
        },
        " surface until later. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "25",
          "sid": "1TI 5:25"
        },
        "In the same way, good deeds ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "are"
          ]
        },
        " obvious, and even the ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "ones that"
          ]
        },
        " are ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "inconspicuous"
          ]
        },
        " cannot remain hidden."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "chapter",
      "marker": "c",
      "number": "6",
      "sid": "1TI 6"
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Serving with Honor"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "EPH 6:5-9",
          "content": [
            "Ephesians 6:5–9"
          ]
        },
        "; ",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "COL 3:22-25",
          "content": [
            "Colossians 3:22–25"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "1",
          "sid": "1TI 6:1"
        },
        "All who are under ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " yoke of slavery should regard ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " masters ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "as"
          ]
        },
        " fully worthy of honor, so that God’s name and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "our"
          ]
        },
        " teaching will not be discredited. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "2",
          "sid": "1TI 6:2"
        },
        "Those who have believing masters should not show disrespect because they are brothers, but should serve ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "them"
          ]
        },
        " all the more, since those receiving ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "their"
          ]
        },
        " good service are beloved believers. Teach and encourage these ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "principles"
          ]
        },
        "."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Reject False Doctrines"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "3",
          "sid": "1TI 6:3"
        },
        "If anyone teaches another doctrine and disagrees ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "with the"
          ]
        },
        " sound words of our Lord Jesus Christ and with godly teaching, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "4",
          "sid": "1TI 6:4"
        },
        "he is conceited ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " understands nothing. Instead, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "he has"
          ]
        },
        " an unhealthy interest in controversies and disputes about words, out of which come envy, strife, abusive talk, evil suspicions, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "5",
          "sid": "1TI 6:5"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " constant friction between men of depraved mind ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "who are"
          ]
        },
        " devoid of the truth. ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "These men"
          ]
        },
        " regard godliness as a means of gain.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "6:5 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR include "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Withdraw yourself from such."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Godliness with Contentment"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "6",
          "sid": "1TI 6:6"
        },
        "Of course, godliness with contentment is great gain. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "7",
          "sid": "1TI 6:7"
        },
        "For we brought nothing into the world, so",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "6:7 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "so certainly"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        " we cannot carry anything ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "out of it"
          ]
        },
        ". ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "8",
          "sid": "1TI 6:8"
        },
        "But if we have food and clothing, we will be content with these."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "9",
          "sid": "1TI 6:9"
        },
        "Those who want to be rich, however, fall into temptation and become ensnared by many foolish and harmful desires that plunge ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "them"
          ]
        },
        " into ruin and destruction. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "10",
          "sid": "1TI 6:10"
        },
        "For the love of money is ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " root of all kinds of evil. By craving ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "it"
          ]
        },
        ", some have wandered away from the faith and pierced themselves with many sorrows."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Fight the Good Fight"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "11",
          "sid": "1TI 6:11"
        },
        "But you, O man of God, flee from these things and pursue righteousness, godliness, faith, love, perseverance, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " gentleness. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "12",
          "sid": "1TI 6:12"
        },
        "Fight the good fight of the faith. Take hold of the eternal life to which you were called ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "when you made"
          ]
        },
        " the good confession before many witnesses."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "13",
          "sid": "1TI 6:13"
        },
        "I charge you in the presence of God, who gives life to all things, and of Christ Jesus, who ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "made"
          ]
        },
        " the good confession in His testimony before Pontius Pilate: ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "14",
          "sid": "1TI 6:14"
        },
        "Keep ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "this"
          ]
        },
        " commandment without stain ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "or"
          ]
        },
        " reproach until the appearance of our Lord Jesus Christ, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "15",
          "sid": "1TI 6:15"
        },
        "which the blessed and only Sovereign ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "One"
          ]
        },
        "— the King of kings and Lord of lords— will bring about in His own time. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "16",
          "sid": "1TI 6:16"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "He"
          ]
        },
        " alone is immortal ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " dwells in unapproachable light. No one has ever seen ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Him"
          ]
        },
        ", nor can ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "anyone"
          ]
        },
        " see ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Him"
          ]
        },
        ". To ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Him be"
          ]
        },
        " honor and eternal dominion! Amen."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "A Charge to the Rich"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "r",
      "content": [
        "(",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "PRO 23:1-5",
          "content": [
            "Proverbs 23:1–5"
          ]
        },
        "; ",
        {
          "type": "ref",
          "loc": "JAS 5:1-6",
          "content": [
            "James 5:1–6"
          ]
        },
        ")"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "17",
          "sid": "1TI 6:17"
        },
        "Instruct those who are rich in the present age not to be conceited ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " not to put their hope in ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "the"
          ]
        },
        " uncertainty of wealth, but in God, who richly provides all things for us to enjoy. ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "18",
          "sid": "1TI 6:18"
        },
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "Instruct them"
          ]
        },
        " to do good, to be rich in good works, ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " to be generous ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "and"
          ]
        },
        " ready to share, ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "19",
          "sid": "1TI 6:19"
        },
        "treasuring up for themselves a firm foundation for the future, so that they may take hold of that which is truly life."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "s1",
      "content": [
        "Guard the Faith"
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        " ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "20",
          "sid": "1TI 6:20"
        },
        "O Timothy, guard what has been entrusted ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "to you"
          ]
        },
        ". Avoid irreverent, empty chatter and the opposing arguments of so-called “knowledge,” ",
        {
          "type": "verse",
          "marker": "v",
          "number": "21",
          "sid": "1TI 6:21"
        },
        "which some have professed and ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "thus"
          ]
        },
        " swerved away from the faith."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "para",
      "marker": "p",
      "content": [
        "Grace ",
        {
          "type": "char",
          "marker": "add",
          "content": [
            "be"
          ]
        },
        " with you all.",
        {
          "type": "note",
          "marker": "f",
          "caller": "+",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fr",
              "content": [
                "6:21 "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "ft",
              "content": [
                "BYZ and TR include "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "char",
              "marker": "fqa",
              "content": [
                "Amen."
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}